Pretrained models
-----------------
The ONNX models distributed in the MediaPipeNet.Models.* packages (and in models/onnx) were converted
from the official Google MediaPipe TFLite releases with tools/model-conversion/convert_models.py:

  * BlazeFace short range, Face Mesh V2, Face Blendshapes      (face_landmarker.task, blaze_face_short_range.tflite)
  * BlazePalm, Hand Landmarks, Gesture Embedder/Classifier       (hand_landmarker.task, gesture_recognizer.task)
  * BlazePose detector, BlazePose GHUM Lite / Full              (pose_detection.tflite, pose_landmarker_*.task)
  * Selfie Segmenter                                            (selfie_segmenter.tflite)
  * EfficientDet-Lite0, EfficientNet-Lite0                      (efficientdet_lite0.tflite, efficientnet_lite0.tflite)

Model weights: Copyright Google LLC, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Please review the MediaPipe model cards (https://ai.google.dev/edge/mediapipe/solutions) for intended
use and limitations before deploying the models.

Test images in tests/assets/images are MediaPipe test assets (Apache-2.0).

